			"notes": "## Added\n- **Mania Helper**: renders full mania pattern on the ground, fixes blocks that don't recolour during mania\n- **Beacon Soul Helper**: send battleship grid to chat\n- **Twinclaws Fix**: change twinclaws sound to make it more noticeable\n- **Twinclaws Alert**: show title during twinclaws\n\n## Fixed\n- Reworked `SlayerUtils` for Hypixel's new slayer armorstand system (hypixel please revert this zzz)\n- Fixed some CME errors\n- Mania session stability fixes\n\n## Changed\n- Odin requirement: `0.3.3` -> `0.3.4`\n- **Splits**: added option `Print Splits` to toggle print damage/mania splits in chat\n- **Boss Highlight**: `Steak colour` option when boss is steakable (fixed, now working)"
